  { cat: "Moda & Beleza", img: "prompt_045.jpg", prompt: "Ultra-realistic low-angle shot of a stunning [GENDER] model wearing a full avant-garde couture outfit entirely made from [CONTAINER/MATERIAL], each compartment holding a real [ITEM], the [CONTAINER/MATERIAL] forming an the coat, sunlight highlighting the texture of the [ITEM] and [CONTAINER/MATERIAL], dramatic blue sky with a few clouds in the background, cinematic high-fashion editorial style, ultra-photorealistic details, shot on Hasselblad H6D 15 5 5 8.1K 03:32" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_046.jpg", prompt: "Create a hyper-realistic and modern storefront entrance designed for a grand opening. The glass doors are closed and sleek. Decorate the area around the entrance with large, visually striking [OBJECT], arranged in a festive and creative way — no balloons or traditional decorations. Use natural daylight with soft cinematic lighting. The setting should feel upscale, clean, and stylish, with an atmosphere of celebration and uniqueness. 9 7 3 2 8K 04:23" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_047.jpg", prompt: "A person washing bright yellow lemons in a traditional stone basin, Mediterranean courtyard setting, warm cream-colored stucco walls with carved decorative details, simple brass spigot with flowing water, rectangular stone trough filled with floating yellow citrus fruits, hands gently rinsing lemons, woven basket nearby, beautiful natural lighting creating soft shadows, textured walls, rustic outdoor washing area, sunny atmosphere, traditional lifestyle scene, warm golden hour lighting, detailed stone textures, peaceful daily life moment 13 9 4 2 1 8.2K 04:36" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_048.jpg", prompt: "A glass capsule with the word \"[SPORT/ACTIVITY]\" written on it, containing an entire miniature [SPORT/ACTIVITY] scene inside, with tiny people engaged in [SPECIFIC ACTIVITY DESCRIPTION], [RELEVANT EQUIPMENT/ENVIRONMENT], placed against a dark gray background. The colors used for the photography should be vibrant, creating a strong contrast between lightness and darkness to highlight the details. This design would be suitable as an advertising poster or packaging logo. 26 5 8.3K 08:25" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_049.jpg", prompt: "A [BRAND]-style [ITEM TYPE], but the [MAIN PART] is made from a realistic ripe [FRUIT/VEGETABLE], [TEXTURE DESCRIPTION], [BRAND LOGO] clearly visible, [STRUCTURAL DETAILS], classic [ITEM TYPE] proportions maintained, product photography, studio lighting, light [COLOR] background, high detail --ar 3:4   example:    A Gucci-style tote bag, but the bag is made from a realistic orange pumpkin, ribbed orange surface with natural pumpkin lines, Gucci logo in gold lettering, leather straps and trim, structured tote bag shape, product photography, studio lighting, light orange background, high detail  --ar 3:4 19 8 2 7.8K edited 04:40" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_050.jpg", prompt: "s   A [MATERIAL] statue of Rolex watch with [SURFACE_EFFECT] all over it. Diorama. Realistic shadow effects. Black background. 4k. Crazy details. 13 7 2 2 1 7.6K 04:31" },
  { cat: "Animais", img: "prompt_051.jpg", prompt: "A white kitten, the main subject, is centered in a full body shot. It wears a pink glittery polka dot headscarf with a bow, pink diamond encrusted sunglasses, and a metal necklace, looking extremely playful. The kitten is reclining back comfortably on a pink beach chair, holding a green coconut with a pink umbrella and a blue straw, sipping from the straw. The background is a beach with a blue sky and the sea. The image combines cute pets, fashion, and vacation elements, with bright and fresh colors, creating a relaxed, trendy, and healing atmosphere that conveys a lazy and comfortable vacation feeling. The composition is clean and simple. Professional DSLR photography, 8K resolution, high detail. detailed fur texture, soft light, natural features. 11 7 2 1 8.1K 05:00" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_052.jpg", prompt: "panoramic view of a bright futuristic city sitting on a floating island high above the clouds, lush forest covering the island with visible rock cliffs underneath, futuristic skyscrapers and a monumental central tower, people walking on sky bridges, maglev trains gliding through buildings, clear sunny sky with few fluffy clouds, utopian atmosphere, realistic photography, shot with Sony Alpha 7R V + FE 16-35mm f/2.8 GM, wide cityscape, aerial angle 10 5 5 4 7.7K 03:55" },
  { cat: "Animais", img: "prompt_053.jpg", prompt: "[Animal] takes a selfie with [animal 1] and [animal 2] standing behind them on the African savannah at sunset --ar 9:16 33 11 9 5 1 7.8K 04:26" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_054.jpg", prompt: "A stylish editorial-style close-up of a transparent glass home fragrance diffuser jar with a wide mouth, filled with golden-amber scented liquid. Thin wooden reeds extend from the jar. A minimal beige label is placed on the front of the jar. The diffuser sits on a neutral surface, surrounded by floating white peonies such as white peonies frozen mid-air. Natural daylight creates soft shadows and enhances the glossy texture of the liquid and glass. Clean, artistic still life inspired by [season or theme]. --ar 3:4 15 1 1 9.4K 07:05" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_055.jpg", prompt: "An aesthetic minimalist breakfast on the table, golden sunlight, Perfectly cooked sunny side eggs, croissants with butter, slices of fresh orange and glasses of bright orange juice. White painted plates and elegant gold cutlery create a modern aesthetic atmosphere, and the tablecloth on the table is olive-colored. Soft natural lighting, high detail, cinematic composition, ultra HD, 8K, --ar 9:16 --v 6.1 --raw 9 5 3 1 1 8.6K 04:40" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_056.jpg", prompt: "A secret open-air night party under the stars, featuring a stylish and diverse group of old men and women (ages 80 and up) dressed in elegant all-white outfits, dancing with their hands in the air. The scene takes place outdoors in a spacious urban rooftop, abandoned lot, or forest clearing surrounded by colorful neon and LED light beams in purple, pink, and electric blue tones. There's a euphoric, luxurious energy people are laughing, dancing, hugging, immersed in music. The white clothing is clearly visible and glows subtly under the lighting, adding contrast and clarity. The environment is moody yet vibrant, with fog, sparkles, soft haze, and light flares. No club walls only freedom, rhythm, and sky. Cinematic, ultra-realistic style, fashion-forward, high-resolution photography feel. --ar 3:4 --v 7.0 10 5 5 1 1 1 8.8K 05:15" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_057.jpg", prompt: "top down flatlay, wide-angled shot of letter-shaped mother of pearls forming the letter [letter]. Organic shapes and flowy vibe. The letters are lying in the sand and are partly sunken in. film grain, film look, fashion editorial vibes, moody and dusty vibes, sleek and moody, shot on Leica M6, Kodak Portra 400 film, subtle film grain, photorealistic texture, cinematic finish 16 4 3 1 1 8.2K edited 05:36" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_058.jpg", prompt: "[dish name] on [color] [material] plate, soft window light from the side, clean minimal composition, [background color] background, shallow DOF, elegant natural food styling --ar 3:4 21 3 2 1 8.6K 08:37" },
  { cat: "Animais", img: "prompt_059.jpg", prompt: "A cute chubby furry cat holds a bouquet of white daisies and small yellow wildflowers, holds the flowers towards the camera, and stands on lush green grass. The chubby cat smiles at the camera. The composition is focused on the lower third of the picture, with rolling emerald green hills extending to snow-capped mountains in the distance, under a cloud-dappled blue sky, bathed in golden morning light, fresh, soft focus and airy atmosphere. --ar 9:16 --v 7.0 10 9 3 2 2 9.1K 08:40" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_060.jpg", prompt: "create one person doing vynasa yoga on a rooftop with columbus skyline on the background using colors of a sunsetn pink / purple --ar 3:4 9 4 2 2 8.3K 05:55" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_061.jpg", prompt: "Close-up of two elegant martini glasses with olives, perfectly chilled, resting on a circular white tray atop a navy and white striped pool float, floating on crystal-clear turquoise water. Reflections of sunlight ripple across the surface, evoking a calm, upscale summer atmosphere. Luxury vacation aesthetic, minimal and refined composition, editorial cocktail photography, cinematic lighting, afternoon sun glow --ar 2:3 --v 7.0 --stylize 1000 12 2 1 8.7K 05:00" },
  { cat: "Moda & Beleza", img: "prompt_062.jpg", prompt: "s   A before and after hair treatment photo of the back view of an attractive woman with long, brown, straight hair. The left side shows her frizzy and dry hair, with visible texture, while the right side has smooth, shiny hair with no residue from product use. The background color should be a neutral gray to highlight the hair transformation and make the products stand out. Use professional lighting for the shot. --ar 3:4 --raw --stylize 150 --v 7.0    A woman applying hair growth serum to her head, close-up of the oil dropper and bottle on top of her head, white background, hair roots slightly wet from pouring, brunette model with straight, long, sleek, shiny hair, hair is straight, long, and dark brown in color, flat lighting, realistic photography --ar 3:4 --raw --stylize 150 --v 7.0 13 12 1 1 1 8.9K 05:04" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_063.jpg", prompt: "drone view of above and behind a woman playing tennis on a green tennis court, the back of the woman, mid-swing, mid-motion, holding a clean white tennis racket, 1980s white pleated mini tennis skirt, white tennis shoes, long dark brown hair, 1970s flicked outward curls, Wimbledon court 19 3 2 2 1 7.9K edited 07:09" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_064.jpg", prompt: "a ice cream popsicle with the [brand] logo on it, in light pink and gold colorway, with dripping texture, decorated by small metallic gold foil on its surface, very detailed 19 4 3 8.1K 07:15" },
  { cat: "Moda & Beleza", img: "prompt_065.jpg", prompt: "A slight top-down photo of the same beautiful k-pop idol feeling Korean woman in her 20's before and after her skin quality enhancement, taken with an iPhone in frontal view as a selfie. Shot inside a house. The left side shows that she has some dark circles and dark spots(severe freckles) under her eyes, dryness on the face. On the right-hand side, she is made up by a makeup artist and looks like having flawless and smooth skin with different mono-tone outfit. She looks expressionless has symmetrical face. Her hair color is black. Make sure you capture the full length from head to chest area. 9 9 4 1 7.9K 04:12" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_066.jpg", prompt: "Jeff Koons [OBJECT] Sculpture, in high gloss chrome finish, standing on a black marbe stand in a luxuirous modern living room. 12 5 2 1 7.8K 04:07" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_067.jpg", prompt: "nike Air Jordan 1 made of [material], kitbash3d, studio photography, stock photo, natural lighting, product view, 8k, Shot on 65mm, --ar 2:3 --v 7.0 --stylize 50 13 6 3 2 1 1 7.3K 06:12" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_068.jpg", prompt: "A cozy workplace with a computer on the table, a cup of coffee next to it, and a few macaroons on a small plate --sref 4271215301 355384905 2601618513 3484190848 12 8 1 1 7.2K 05:08" },
  { cat: "Moda & Beleza", img: "prompt_069.jpg", prompt: "ultra-close-up beauty portrait of a young woman with moistened skin, natural skin texture with visible pores and slight glow, moist natural lips in light rose, sharp heterochromia eyes with clear catchlight, white background, high-key beauty lighting with soft frontal fill and rim backlight, orchid flower near face, soft highlights on cheekbones and nose, no retouching effect, commercial skincare ad aesthetic, medium format camera look --ar 9:16 25 2 2 2 2 8.5K 06:38" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_070.jpg", prompt: "A sofa made of [fruit], against a white background, hyper-realistic photography. 15 4 2 7.3K 07:43" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_071.jpg", prompt: "modern beach whit sunbeds, cinematic lighting, ultra-detailed, 8K resolution --ar 16:9 7 6 2 1 7.5K 08:22" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_072.jpg", prompt: "A sleek, ultra-modern convertible sports car driving on a vibrant Dubai street during a sunny day, no people, futuristic design, glossy metallic finish, palm trees and luxurious skyscrapers in the background, bright blue sky, dynamic angle, cinematic lighting, highly detailed, photorealistic, 8k resolution --ar 3:4 13 2 8.3K 08:25" },
  { cat: "Icones & UI", img: "prompt_073.jpg", prompt: "3D render of a light [color] twisted shape with soft gradient, smooth curves, rounded edges, and glossy plastic texture. Matte finish. No shadows. White background. Minimal icon style --s 250 --v 6.1 8 7 2 1 7.9K 04:39" },
  { cat: "Moda & Beleza", img: "prompt_074.jpg", prompt: "A high-fashion beauty collage showcasing three elegant and trendy makeup looks for a stylish evening in 2025. The first section features a radiant, sun-kissed look with soft golden tones, luminous skin, warm bronze eyeshadow, and a natural glossy lip. The second section presents a dramatic evening style with deep, smoldering eyeshadow, bold eyeliner, and a matte lip for a striking effect. The third section highlights a soft and romantic aesthetic with subtle rosy blush, delicate pink tones, and a fresh, dewy glow. The collage is arranged in a sleek editorial composition, blending modern beauty trends with warm golden and moody lighting, enhancing depth and texture. Ultra-detailed textures, cinematic beauty photography, crisp high-end editorial finish, no text, no watermark 11 4 3 1 8.3K 04:48" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_075.jpg", prompt: "A real pink helicopter. A huge number of delicate pink roses are spilling out of the helicopter cargo hold. It's summer. There's a blue sky and green grass in the background. Super-realistic photo, hyper-realistic, ultra-detailed textures, cinematic photography, crisp high-end editorial finish, no text, no watermark --ar 3:4 7 6 3 2 2 1 8.4K 04:37" },
  { cat: "Animais", img: "prompt_076.jpg", prompt: "Photo of a (breed) peeking over the edge, eye-to-eye with (object) on a white table, against a simple solid white background. The image is cute and quirky, with a minimalistic style 9 2 2 1 8.6K 04:54" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_077.jpg", prompt: "Realistic lightning bolt striking over city skyline, dark storm clouds, bright electric flash illuminating buildings, dramatic weather photography, urban landscape during thunderstorm, professional lightning photography, natural lighting effects, photorealistic storm scene --ar 16:9 6 5 2 2 2 8.7K 08:59" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_078.jpg", prompt: "ultra-realistic [FRUIT] fully encased inside a clear ice cube with sharp, geometric edges, [FRUIT_DESCRIPTION] visible through the frozen surface, small frost particles and air bubbles inside, placed on clean white background, professional product photography lighting, macro-level texture detail, minimalist commercial composition --s 250 13 6 5 2 1 8.2K 07:14" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_079.jpg", prompt: "Modern luxurious kitchen with marble island, vertical wooden slat paneling, minimalist pendant globe lights, olive green velvet barstools with black metal frames, mesh sliding doors, clean white walls, high ceilings, elegant marble backsplash, soft ambient lighting, architectural interior photography, high-end design, neutral color palette, warm wood tones, ultra-realistic rendering, professional interior design, glossy marble surfaces --ar 4:5 --profile 61y35wu --v 7.0 12 9 1 1 6.9K 06:27" },
  { cat: "Produtos & Publicidade", img: "prompt_080.jpg", prompt: "professional photograph, advertisng, eye level shot, three quarters angle of a a mercedes beside angular brutalist architecture, camera positioned slightly off-center, building makes graphic shapes with shadows, Canon R5 camera, 50mm f.2.8 , hard sunlight creating sharp shaddows --ar 4:3 --p a28eow3 --s 0 --v 6.1 12 7 2 1 7.6K edited 05:09" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_081.jpg", prompt: "Create a vivid, high quality image on a white background of the following items on a plate: chocolate, grapes, onions, garlic, avocado, citrus, coffee, macadamia nuts, and walnuts --v 6.1 --ar 2:3 13 6 1 1 7.2K 09:01" },
  { cat: "Animais", img: "prompt_082.jpg", prompt: "a close-up studio photo of a single pink calla lily flower with a pair of luxurious diamond rings on its green stem, white background, soft natural lighting, high-end jewelry advertisement, ultra-realistic, macro photography style, high detail, minimalistic composition, style photographic    prompt:  A hyper-realistic studio photo of a large blooming allium flower with delicate purple petals, placed on the left side of the frame. A luxurious square-cut diamond ring with a double halo and pavé band is carefully balanced on the curved green stem. Clean white background, soft studio lighting, sharp detail on the gemstone and flower texture, minimalistic high-end composition, luxury jewelry editorial style 12 10 3 2 1 7.8K 04:41" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_083.jpg", prompt: "Ice latte cup mockup, high quality commercial layout, hard flash, in the style of Unsplash photography, flash light, hard shadows, noise. --no people --ar 3:4 --profile ucqtzut --stylize 40 --v 7.0 12 6 4 2 1 6.9K 04:58" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_084.jpg", prompt: "pink letters [letter], inflatable, in watter^ cinematic, top view --ar 3:4 --v 7.0 10 6 4 2 1 7.3K 05:32" },
  { cat: "Comida & Bebida", img: "prompt_085.jpg", prompt: "coctails set in the bar , high quality commercial layout, hard flash, in the style of Unsplash photography, flash light, hard shadows, noise. --no people --ar 3:4 --profile ucqtzut --stylize 40 --sref https://s.mj.run/Umjp4nApMLE 8 5 2 1 1 8.3K 05:14" },
  { cat: "Paisagens & Cidades", img: "prompt_086.jpg", prompt: "a striking scene of a young woman walking down a winding path surrounded by vibrant green, fluffy grass fields. The solitary Woman, dressed in a white suit, contrasts starkly with the green landscape, giving the image a surreal and dreamlike quality. The path cuts smoothly through the terrain, inviting thoughts about solitude, direction, and individuality --ar 9:16 13 6 4 1 1 7.4K 10:12" },
  { cat: "Objetos & Arte", img: "prompt_087.jpg", prompt: "Create a collectible vinyl figure. The a transparent robot shaped body is the base design, the entire figure is filled with flowers. 3D render, c4d, octane render, natural light and subtle shadows --ar 9:16 --v 7.0 21 2 7.7K 10:15" }
